  "solution": "Gọi bán kính nóc tháp là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>, bán kính đáy tháp là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math>.<br>Vì khoảng cách từ nóc tháp đến tâm đối xứng của hypebol bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></semantics></math> khoảng cách từ tâm đối xứng đến đáy nên ta có khoảng cách từ nóc tháp đến tâm đối là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>60</mn></semantics></math> m, khoảng cách từ tâm đối xứng đến đáy là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>90</mn></semantics></math> m.<br>Khi đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>90</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> thuộc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta có \n\t\t<ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mn>28</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>60</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mn>42</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>384</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mn>28</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>90</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mn>42</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>4</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>384</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\tSuy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>274</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>149</mn></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>181</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
